    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94914" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκίπων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽσκίμπτομαἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆπτρον</span>
			, <i>staff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				65
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				239
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				727
			</span></i>; <i>crutch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).121.111
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς., γεροντικὸν ὅπλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.134
			</span></i>.—The form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκίμπων</span></b>  occurs as v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c., etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήπων</span></b> 
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.293
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				294
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				7.65
			</span></i> (Antip.), <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
			</span></i>l.c., etc., recognized also by <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				127
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
